  <spoon:CtClass name="BoilerController">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="The steam-boiler control program (SB-V1): a single-method, mode-nested&#xA;if-else state machine over the five {@link BoilerMode}s (SB-V2). One call&#xA;to {@link #step(InputEvent)} handles one five-second cycle (SB-V3): the&#xA;incoming batch has already been ingested by the Sensor layer, the derived&#xA;quantities are refreshed through the operations, and exactly one outgoing&#xA;transition of the current mode is selected.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>Priority discipline (SB-FR8): within every mode block the inner chain&#xA;is ordered emergency-stop conditions first (transmission failure, STOP&#xA;demand, level risk, and in rescue the vital-unit failures), then rescue,&#xA;then degraded, then regulation. Every branch conjoins the explicit&#xA;negation of each higher-priority triggerless guard, per the admitted&#xA;convention (see reference-runs/lre LreController).&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>Emergency stop is terminal (SB-Beh22): its mode block is empty &#x2014; the&#xA;program's control task has ended and no transition leaves the mode. The&#xA;final MODE(emergency stop) message is emitted inline on each transition&#xA;into the mode; thereafter the program stops (the boundary loop halts)."/>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
    <modifier>FINAL</modifier>
    <typeMember xsi:type="spoon:CtField" name="currentMode">
      <modifier>PRIVATE</modifier>
      <type name="BoilerMode">
        <packageRef isImplicit="true" name="steamboiler.mode"/>
      </type>
      <assignment xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldRead">
        <type name="BoilerMode">
          <packageRef name="steamboiler.mode"/>
        </type>
        <variable xsi:type="spoon:CtFieldReference" name="INITIALIZATION" isFinal="true" isStatic="true">
          <declaringType name="BoilerMode">
            <packageRef name="steamboiler.mode"/>
          </declaringType>
        </variable>
        <target xsi:type="spoon:CtTypeAccess">
          <type name="void"/>
          <accessedType name="BoilerMode">
            <packageRef isImplicit="true" name="steamboiler.mode"/>
          </accessedType>
        </target>
      </assignment>
    </typeMember>
