      <comment commentContent="sensor function calls (reads this) into the emitted postconditions;"/>
      <comment commentContent="those cannot be proven stable across mode := X in Dafny's frame"/>
      <comment commentContent="analysis. Promoting the predicates to fields makes the postconditions"/>
      <comment commentContent="reference the field names directly (see the LRE reference controller's"/>
      <comment commentContent="iteration-3 diagnosis of the same defect). ----"/>
