  <spoon:CtClass name="Sensor">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="Ingests one {@link TransmissionData} batch per five-second cycle (SB-V3)&#xA;and exposes the controller-facing view of the plant: current readings,&#xA;protocol-phase latches, the STOP counter (SB-V10), transmission-failure&#xA;verdicts (SB-FR5), and the unit failure detections (SB-FR1..SB-FR4)&#xA;recorded in the {@link StatusRegister} (SB-V9).&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>All controller-guard-facing methods return plain values with safe&#xA;defaults; no sentinel values reach the controller. Worst-case per-cycle&#xA;water-balance bounds (used by the level estimation operation, SB-V8,&#xA;SB-Beh13, SB-Beh25) are computed here so operation compute() bodies stay&#xA;assignment-only."/>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
    <modifier>FINAL</modifier>
